<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 194 0 R
/E (The piece aims to explore the act of instrumental performance by taking a close look into the physical and visual aspects of sound production. The camera is pointed at different parts of the performer, framing its actions through the radical change of scale in the image. At the same time, both the video and the sound are gradually transformed by digital means, blurring the line between human performance and electronic sound production.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
