278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 196 0 R
/T (Dispositivo 1: Asiento por favor is a sound installation built around an acoustic and electroacoustic instrument created from an everyday object: a chair. Using this instrument an interactive sound installation is created, where the audience is invited to engage with the piece, exploring its logic \(or lack thereof\) while affecting and interfering with the sound environment of the space through their actions.)
/E (Dispositivo 1: Asiento por favor is a sound installation built around an acoustic and electroacoustic instrument created from an everyday object: a chair. Using this instrument an interactive sound installation is created, where the audience is invited to engage with the piece, exploring its logic \(or lack thereof\) while affecting and interfering with the sound environment of the space through their actions.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (The work highlights the sonic qualities of everyday objects through a process of amplification, transformation, and estrangement. Through a series of electroacoustic procedures, the sound originating from the chair is distorted as it travels through the space, enveloping the audience and transforming the soundscape organically as the interactions with the object vary. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
