/Title (Dispositivo 1: Asiento por favor is a sound installation built around an acoustic and electroacoustic instrument created from an everyday object: a chair. Using this instrument an interactive sound installation is created, where the audience is invited to engage with the piece, exploring its logic \(or lack thereof\) while affecting and interfering with the sound environment of the space through their actions.)
